STRUCTURAL FLOOR (independent of power): the exact two-sided sign-flip permutation
p-value for n=5 paired has minimum 2/2^5 = 0.0625.  This does NOT bind the TOST
(equivalence is one-sided x2 and is run parametrically), but it DOES bind R4'
('A4 significantly better', §5.2) if a distribution-free test is ever demanded:
   n=4: min two-sided permutation p = 2/2^4 = 0.1250
   n=5: min two-sided permutation p = 2/2^5 = 0.0625
   n=6: min two-sided permutation p = 2/2^6 = 0.0312   <- first n reaching p<0.05
   n=7: min two-sided permutation p = 2/2^7 = 0.0156
   n=8: min two-sided permutation p = 2/2^8 = 0.0078

